## 🚀 QUICK‑START ROADMAP – Top 3 Priority Areas  
**Project:** PPSDM‑KMITS Next.js app (`https://github.com/kmits-edu/pps-dm-kmits`)  
**Scope:** Address the three highest‑impact gaps identified in the audit – **UI/UX Consistency & Accessibility**, **Frontend Code‑Splitting & Performance**, **Backend Rate‑Limiting & Validation**.  

The plan is broken into three **epics** (one per priority). Each epic is further divided into **engineering tasks** that can be taken straight into a pull‑request.  

---  

## 1️⃣ EPIC 1 – UI/UX Consistency & Accessibility  

| # | Task | Modified Files / Paths | Specific Code Changes | Acceptance Test / Verification | Estimated Complexity* |
